From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 12:56:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] pipeline: simple: Allow the software ISP on mtk-seninf

MT6789 has the mtk-seninf CSI receiver but no mtk-mdp converter for the
simple pipeline to use. The software ISP is still skipped whenever a
converter is found, so platforms with MDP keep it.

Tested on a Zinwa Q25 (MT6789).
---
 src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
index 35e06649..79efc8e9 100644
--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
@@ -262,7 +262,7 @@ static const SimplePipelineInfo supportedDevices[] = {
 	{ "intel-ipu6", {}, true },
 	{ "intel-ipu7", {}, true },
 	{ "j721e-csi2rx", {}, true },
-	{ "mtk-seninf", { { "mtk-mdp", 3 } }, false },
+	{ "mtk-seninf", { { "mtk-mdp", 3 } }, true },
 	{ "mxc-isi", {}, false },
 	{ "qcom-camss", {}, true },
 	{ "sun6i-csi", {}, false },
